+      "rationale": "The 13 polyprotein CDS records range from 9,653 nt to 26,315 nt and show a wide GC range from 34.26% to 56.12%. Outliers include high-GC Bole tick virus 4 and Wenling shark virus, and low-GC Sanxia water strider virus 6 and Wuhan centipede virus. This spread is large enough to support a focused composition-based comparison within the polyprotein subset.",
